*{{m|Leech Life}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Kabutops}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Kabutops}}.

